background-size: cover;"><div class="o-container u-text-color-white u-pt48 u-pb48"><div class="o-grid o-grid--small-full o-grid--medium-full"><div class="o-grid__cell o-grid__cell--width-55"><h1>Join CSA. Get Frontier Ready.</h1><h3 class="u-text--normal">Prepare for machine-speed cybersecurity with CSA
Corporate Membership + Frontier Ready Support.</h3><a class="c-button c-button--orange u-mt40" data-controller="record-link-interaction" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-id-value="1" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-type-value="HomePage" data-record-link-interaction-action-value="click" data-record-link-interaction-notes-value="[&quot;/membership/frontier-ready&quot;,&quot;#homepage-hero&quot;]" href="/membership/frontier-ready">Learn more</a></div></div></div></li><li class="glide__slide tweak-responsive-hero" style="background-image: url(/assets/home/taise-carousel-background-6e84863b631bd1ae4832bf95235d66e64b95680d4a56deaca4668a488b496d23.jpg);
background-size: cover;"><div class="o-container u-text-color-black u-pt48 u-pb48"><div class="o-grid o-grid--small-full o-grid--medium-full"><div class="o-grid__cell o-grid__cell--width-55"><h1>Trusted AI Safety Expert (TAISE) Certificate</h1><h3 class="u-text--normal">Now Available: The Industry’s First Credential for Trustworthy AI.</h3><a class="c-button c-button--orange u-mt40" data-controller="record-link-interaction" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-id-value="1" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-type-value="HomePage" data-record-link-interaction-action-value="click" data-record-link-interaction-notes-value="[&quot;/artifacts/taise-prep-kit&quot;,&quot;#homepage-hero&quot;]" href="/artifacts/taise-prep-kit">Download the Prep-Kit</a></div><div class="o-grid__cell o-grid__cell--width-45"></div></div></div></li><li class="glide__slide tweak-responsive-hero" style="background-image: url(/assets/home/aicm-cso-award-carousel-slider-background-9eaf96d553f0f147f1019574381165081f870209c104fb4aa11013440d29772e.jpg);
background-size: cover;"><div class="o-container u-pt48 u-pb48"><div class="o-grid o-grid--small-full o-grid--medium-full"><div class="o-grid__cell o-grid__cell--width-55"><h1>Build Trustworthy AI with CSA's AI Controls Matrix</h1><h3 class="u-text--normal">A first-of-its-kind framework aligning with ISO 42001,
NIST AI RMF, and the EU AI Act to help organizations
design, implement, and operate AI responsibly.</h3><a class="c-button c-button--orange u-mt40" data-controller="record-link-interaction" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-id-value="1" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-type-value="HomePage" data-record-link-interaction-action-value="click" data-record-link-interaction-notes-value="[&quot;/artifacts/ai-controls-matrix-v1-1&quot;,&quot;#homepage-hero&quot;]" href="/artifacts/ai-controls-matrix-v1-1">Download the AICM</a></div></div></div></li></ul></div><div class="glide__arrows u-hidden--mobile" data-glide-el="controls"><button class="glide__arrow glide__arrow--left glide__arrow--blended" data-glide-dir="&lt;"><i class="fas fa-chevron-left fa-2x"></i></button><button class="glide__arrow glide__arrow--right glide__arrow--blended" data-glide-dir="&gt;"><i class="fas fa-chevron-right fa-2x"></i></button></div><div class="glide__bullets" data-glide-el="controls[nav]"><button class="glide__bullet" data-glide-dir="=0"></button><button class="glide__bullet" data-glide-dir="=1"></button><button class="glide__bullet" data-glide-dir="=2"></button></div></div></div></div><div class="o-area o-area--separated"><div class="o-container" id="homepage-news"><h2 class="c-heading c-heading--section">Latest from CSA</h2><div class="c-panel c-panel--floating c-panel--transparent o-grid o-grid--small-full o-grid--medium-full"><div class="o-grid__cell"><div class="c-card c-card--exhibit c-card--actionable"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--revealable c-card__item--decoration" style="overflow: hidden;"><div class="c-card__revealed"><img width="381" height="254" srcset="https://cloudsecurityalliance.org/rails/active_storage/representations/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6Njg4NzgsInB1ciI6ImJsb2JfaWQifX0=--b159fd03fd6e28a7c0640e10c979b8a6dd3d0fca/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6eyJmb3JtYXQiOiJqcGciLCJhdXRvX29yaWVudCI6dHJ1ZSwicm90YXRlIjowLCJncmF2aXR5IjoiY2VudGVyIiwiYmFja2dyb3VuZCI6Im5vbmUiLCJyZXNpemUiOiIzODF4MjU0In0sInB1ciI6InZhcmlhdGlvbiJ9fQ==--ff430b8084ee873e4fe71da89c9fc4d8a664848c/Designing%20the%20AI%20First%20Security%20Org%20-%20Latest%20News.jpg 1x,
                 https://cloudsecurityalliance.org/rails/active_storage/representations/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6Njg4NzgsInB1ciI6ImJsb2JfaWQifX0=--b159fd03fd6e28a7c0640e10c979b8a6dd3d0fca/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6eyJmb3JtYXQiOiJqcGciLCJhdXRvX29yaWVudCI6dHJ1ZSwicm90YXRlIjowLCJncmF2aXR5IjoiY2VudGVyIiwiYmFja2dyb3VuZCI6Im5vbmUiLCJyZXNpemUiOiI3NjJ4NTA4In0sInB1ciI6InZhcmlhdGlvbiJ9fQ==--1486d3bb2283d4e856aa34b9a64840ec1d080e4c/Designing%20the%20AI%20First%20Security%20Org%20-%20Latest%20News.jpg 2x" alt="Designing the AI-First Security Organization" style="min-width: 100%; height: auto;" src="https://cloudsecurityalliance.org/rails/active_storage/representations/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6Njg4NzgsInB1ciI6ImJsb2JfaWQifX0=--b159fd03fd6e28a7c0640e10c979b8a6dd3d0fca/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6eyJmb3JtYXQiOiJqcGciLCJhdXRvX29yaWVudCI6dHJ1ZSwicm90YXRlIjowLCJncmF2aXR5IjoiY2VudGVyIiwiYmFja2dyb3VuZCI6Im5vbmUiLCJyZXNpemUiOiIzODF4MjU0In0sInB1ciI6InZhcmlhdGlvbiJ9fQ==--ff430b8084ee873e4fe71da89c9fc4d8a664848c/Designing%20the%20AI%20First%20Security%20Org%20-%20Latest%20News.jpg" /></div><div class="c-card__consealed"><p class="u-text-color-white">
  Explore how AI is transforming security teams, roles, and responsibilities. Learn a practical framework for restructuring security functions, integrating automation, establishing AI governance, and shifting human expertise toward oversight and decision-making.

</p><a class="u-position-center" data-controller="record-link-interaction" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-id-value="27" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-type-value="ContentGroup" data-record-link-interaction-action-value="click" data-record-link-interaction-notes-value="[&quot;https://cloudsecurityalliance.org/artifacts/designing-the-ai-first-security-organization&quot;,&quot;#homepage-news&quot;]" href="https://cloudsecurityalliance.org/artifacts/designing-the-ai-first-security-organization"></a></div></div><div class="c-card_item"><h5 style="margin: 12px;">Designing the AI-First Security Organization</h5></div><a class="u-position-center" data-controller="record-link-interaction" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-id-value="27" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-type-value="ContentGroup" data-record-link-interaction-action-value="click" data-record-link-interaction-notes-value="[&quot;https://cloudsecurityalliance.org/artifacts/designing-the-ai-first-security-organization&quot;,&quot;#homepage-news&quot;]" href="https://cloudsecurityalliance.org/artifacts/designing-the-ai-first-security-organization"></a></div></div><div class="o-grid__cell"><div class="c-card c-card--exhibit c-card--actionable"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--revealable c-card__item--decoration" style="overflow: hidden;"><div class="c-card__revealed"><img width="381" height="254" srcset="https://cloudsecurityalliance.org/rails/active_storage/representations/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6Njg5MTYsInB1ciI6ImJsb2JfaWQifX0=--8f7a2a98c7be99d146d57805ba216feaaf9185b3/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6eyJmb3JtYXQiOiJqcGciLCJhdXRvX29yaWVudCI6dHJ1ZSwicm90YXRlIjowLCJncmF2aXR5IjoiY2VudGVyIiwiYmFja2dyb3VuZCI6Im5vbmUiLCJyZXNpemUiOiIzODF4MjU0In0sInB1ciI6InZhcmlhdGlvbiJ9fQ==--ff430b8084ee873e4fe71da89c9fc4d8a664848c/AI,%20Code%20Security%20and%20Autonomous%20Remediation%20-%20Latest%20News%20(1).jpg 1x,
                 https://cloudsecurityalliance.org/rails/active_storage/representations/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6Njg5MTYsInB1ciI6ImJsb2JfaWQifX0=--8f7a2a98c7be99d146d57805ba216feaaf9185b3/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6eyJmb3JtYXQiOiJqcGciLCJhdXRvX29yaWVudCI6dHJ1ZSwicm90YXRlIjowLCJncmF2aXR5IjoiY2VudGVyIiwiYmFja2dyb3VuZCI6Im5vbmUiLCJyZXNpemUiOiI3NjJ4NTA4In0sInB1ciI6InZhcmlhdGlvbiJ9fQ==--1486d3bb2283d4e856aa34b9a64840ec1d080e4c/AI,%20Code%20Security%20and%20Autonomous%20Remediation%20-%20Latest%20News%20(1).jpg 2x" alt="Take the Survey: State of AI, Code Security, and Autonomous Remediation" style="min-width: 100%; height: auto;" src="https://cloudsecurityalliance.org/rails/active_storage/representations/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6Njg5MTYsInB1ciI6ImJsb2JfaWQifX0=--8f7a2a98c7be99d146d57805ba216feaaf9185b3/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6eyJmb3JtYXQiOiJqcGciLCJhdXRvX29yaWVudCI6dHJ1ZSwicm90YXRlIjowLCJncmF2aXR5IjoiY2VudGVyIiwiYmFja2dyb3VuZCI6Im5vbmUiLCJyZXNpemUiOiIzODF4MjU0In0sInB1ciI6InZhcmlhdGlvbiJ9fQ==--ff430b8084ee873e4fe71da89c9fc4d8a664848c/AI,%20Code%20Security%20and%20Autonomous%20Remediation%20-%20Latest%20News%20(1).jpg" /></div><div class="c-card__consealed"><p class="u-text-color-white">
  Share your insights in CSA and Google's 8-minute survey on AI security, code vulnerabilities, and autonomous remediation. Help shape research on how organizations are adapting to AI-driven security challenges. Complete the survey by November 20.

</p><a class="u-position-center" data-controller="record-link-interaction" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-id-value="29" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-type-value="ContentGroup" data-record-link-interaction-action-value="click" data-record-link-interaction-notes-value="[&quot;https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/Codesecurity2026&quot;,&quot;#homepage-news&quot;]" href="https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/Codesecurity2026"></a></div></div><div class="c-card_item"><h5 style="margin: 12px;">Take the Survey: State of AI, Code Security, and Autonomous Remediation</h5></div><a class="u-position-center" data-controller="record-link-interaction" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-id-value="29" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-type-value="ContentGroup" data-record-link-interaction-action-value="click" data-record-link-interaction-notes-value="[&quot;https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/Codesecurity2026&quot;,&quot;#homepage-news&quot;]" href="https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/Codesecurity2026"></a></div></div><div class="o-grid__cell"><div class="c-card c-card--exhibit c-card--actionable"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--revealable c-card__item--decoration" style="overflow: hidden;"><div class="c-card__revealed"><img width="381" height="254" srcset="https://cloudsecurityalliance.org/rails/active_storage/representations/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6Njg4ODcsInB1ciI6ImJsb2JfaWQifX0=--90be7cdd6b512bb13ac1372c4b044342943812e2/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6eyJmb3JtYXQiOiJqcGciLCJhdXRvX29yaWVudCI6dHJ1ZSwicm90YXRlIjowLCJncmF2aXR5IjoiY2VudGVyIiwiYmFja2dyb3VuZCI6Im5vbmUiLCJyZXNpemUiOiIzODF4MjU0In0sInB1ciI6InZhcmlhdGlvbiJ9fQ==--ff430b8084ee873e4fe71da89c9fc4d8a664848c/CSA%20Frontier%20Ready%20Training%20-%20Latest%20News.jpg 1x,
                 https://cloudsecurityalliance.org/rails/active_storage/representations/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6Njg4ODcsInB1ciI6ImJsb2JfaWQifX0=--90be7cdd6b512bb13ac1372c4b044342943812e2/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6eyJmb3JtYXQiOiJqcGciLCJhdXRvX29yaWVudCI6dHJ1ZSwicm90YXRlIjowLCJncmF2aXR5IjoiY2VudGVyIiwiYmFja2dyb3VuZCI6Im5vbmUiLCJyZXNpemUiOiI3NjJ4NTA4In0sInB1ciI6InZhcmlhdGlvbiJ9fQ==--1486d3bb2283d4e856aa34b9a64840ec1d080e4c/CSA%20Frontier%20Ready%20Training%20-%20Latest%20News.jpg 2x" alt="Frontier Ready Training: Practical Courses for Emerging Security Challenges" style="min-width: 100%; height: auto;" src="https://cloudsecurityalliance.org/rails/active_storage/representations/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6Njg4ODcsInB1ciI6ImJsb2JfaWQifX0=--90be7cdd6b512bb13ac1372c4b044342943812e2/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6eyJmb3JtYXQiOiJqcGciLCJhdXRvX29yaWVudCI6dHJ1ZSwicm90YXRlIjowLCJncmF2aXR5IjoiY2VudGVyIiwiYmFja2dyb3VuZCI6Im5vbmUiLCJyZXNpemUiOiIzODF4MjU0In0sInB1ciI6InZhcmlhdGlvbiJ9fQ==--ff430b8084ee873e4fe71da89c9fc4d8a664848c/CSA%20Frontier%20Ready%20Training%20-%20Latest%20News.jpg" /></div><div class="c-card__consealed"><p class="u-text-color-white">
  Turn CSA research into actionable security knowledge with self-paced courses. Explore responsible AI use in healthcare, AI evaluation breaches and third-party risk, and AI-accelerated vulnerability discovery to prepare for evolving security challenges.

</p><a class="u-position-center" data-controller="record-link-interaction" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-id-value="28" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-type-value="ContentGroup" data-record-link-interaction-action-value="click" data-record-link-interaction-notes-value="[&quot;https://training.cloudsecurityalliance.org/page/frontier-ready-training&quot;,&quot;#homepage-news&quot;]" href="https://training.cloudsecurityalliance.org/page/frontier-ready-training"></a></div></div><div class="c-card_item"><h5 style="margin: 12px;">Frontier Ready Training: Practical Courses for Emerging Security Challenges</h5></div><a class="u-position-center" data-controller="record-link-interaction" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-id-value="28" data-record-link-interaction-interactable-type-value="ContentGroup" data-record-link-interaction-action-value="click" data-record-link-interaction-notes-value="[&quot;https://training.cloudsecurityalliance.org/page/frontier-ready-training&quot;,&quot;#homepage-news&quot;]" href="https://training.cloudsecurityalliance.org/page/frontier-ready-training"></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="o-area o-area--alternating o-area--separated u-pt80"><style>.c-card__item.c-card__item--revealable .hide-on-hover {
