}</style><div class="o-container" id="homepage-who-we-are"><div class="o-grid u-flex-align-items-center o-grid--small-full o-grid--medium-full o-grid-mobile o-grid-mobile--flip"><div class="o-grid__cell o-grid__cell--width-60"><div class="glide glide--new-style u-pb20" id="who-we-are-carousel"><div class="glide__track" data-glide-el="track"><ul class="glide__slides"><li class="glide__slide"><div class="c-card c-card--exhibit"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--revealable c-card__item--decoration"><div class="c-card__revealed"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/home/strategic-cloud-security-solutions-0a0cf4bd656a60c319aa6aa77268e2ba161250f7e5e20993c85e87ae068fa03e.jpg" /><div class="gradient"></div><div class="hide-on-hover"><h6 class="u-text-color-white"><strong>Strategic Cloud Security Solutions</strong></h6><p class="u-small u-text-color-gray-75 u-mb4" style="line-height: 1.3em">For c-level and leaders</p></div></div><div class="c-card__consealed"><p><a class="u-text-color-blue-300 u-arrow-link" href="/star">Security assurance with STAR</a></p><p><a class="u-text-color-blue-300 u-arrow-link" href="/research/working-groups/artificial-intelligence">CSA’s AI Safety Initiative</a></p><p><a class="u-text-color-blue-300 u-arrow-link" href="/education/cczt">Get Zero Trust certified</a></p></div></div></div></li><li class="glide__slide"><div class="c-card c-card--exhibit"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--revealable c-card__item--decoration"><div class="c-card__revealed"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/home/protecting-the-cloud-7a0dfc9f66024fa2736656f03a79c7fe8e90d72497e15ca05a3e5c897da27746.jpg" /><div class="gradient"></div><div class="hide-on-hover"><h6 class="u-text-color-white"><strong>Protecting the Cloud</strong></h6><p class="u-small u-text-color-gray-75 u-mb4" style="line-height: 1.3em">For cloud security professionals</p></div></div><div class="c-card__consealed"><p><a class="u-text-color-blue-300 u-arrow-link" href="/research/cloud-controls-matrix">Stay Compliant with CCM &amp; CAIQ</a></p><p><a class="u-text-color-blue-300 u-arrow-link" href="/education/ccsk">Master the Cloud with CCSK</a></p><p><a class="u-text-color-blue-300 u-arrow-link" href="/research/guidance">Expert Cloud Security Best Practices</a></p></div></div></div></li><li class="glide__slide"><div class="c-card c-card--exhibit"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--revealable c-card__item--decoration"><div class="c-card__revealed"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/home/explore-the-future-of-cloud-security-fa63a5ecb0093f82319c3f6da66fd0b4639dae3beffd64dc5573886e614ee422.jpg" /><div class="gradient"></div><div class="hide-on-hover"><h6 class="u-text-color-white"><strong>Explore the Future of Cloud Security</strong></h6><p class="u-small u-text-color-gray-75 u-mb4" style="line-height: 1.3em">For enthusiasts and academics</p></div></div><div class="c-card__consealed"><p><a class="u-text-color-blue-300 u-arrow-link" href="/education">Comprehensive Training &amp; Certificates</a></p><p><a class="u-text-color-blue-300 u-arrow-link" href="/events">Virtual &amp; In-Person Events</a></p><p><a class="u-text-color-blue-300 u-arrow-link" href="/blog">Latest in Cloud Security Blog</a></p></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="o-grid__cell o-grid__cell--width-5"></div><div class="o-grid__cell o-grid__cell--width-35"><div class="c-card c-card--vanilla u-bg-color-white u-mb48 u-mt48"><div class="c-card__item" style="padding: 32px 24px;"><h3>Who We Are</h3><h5>The Cloud Security Alliance (CSA) is the world's leading not-for-profit organization
committed to awareness, implementation, and credentialing of AI, cloud, and Zero Trust.</h5><p class="u-text-color-gray-400">Explore resources and expertise for your journey in the cloud at any level.</p><div style="display: none;"><h5 id="your-csa-account">Your Cloud Security Alliance Account</h5><p class="u-text-color-gray-400"><span>Sign in with a free Cloud Security Alliance account – using your e-mail address or your Google account – to join research working groups, download research publications, take CSA training courses and certification exams (such as the CCSK), and access STARWatch and the STAR Registry. Learn how we collect and use your information, including data received through Sign in with Google, in our</span> <a href="/legal/privacy-notice/">Privacy Notice</a><span>.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="o-area o-area--alternating o-area--separated o-area--layered u-pb72 u-pt48" style="background: none"><div class="o-area__layer" style="background: linear-gradient(0deg, rgb(255,255,255) 15%, rgb(172,218,255) 60%, rgb(122,197,255) 80%, rgb(51,167,255) 100%);"></div><div class="o-area__layer" style="background: none; background-image: url(/assets/home/education-bg-af221169334a512fa8fb952dd45f25a3648dd7db0d3521fb1925086b650fa89c.png); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: auto 600px;"></div><div class="o-area__top-layer"><div class="o-container" data-controller="dynamic-content"><div class="o-grid o-grid--small-full o-grid--medium-full u-flex-align-items-center u-pt24 u-desktop-pb48" id="homepage-education"><div class="o-grid__cell o-grid__cell--width-30"><div class="c-card c-card--glass-dark u-text-color-white u-pr16 u-pl16 u-pt16 u-pb16"><div class="c-card__item"><h2>Advance Your Career</h2><p class="u-text-color-gray-50">CSA curriculum is crafted by industry experts. Join the countless
professionals who have selected CSA for their training and certification needs.</p><div id="view-courses-selected" style="display: none;"><div class="c-button-group u-align-center u-pt12"><a class="c-button c-button--slim c-button--blue-300 u-flex-grow-1 c-button--ghost" data-action="click-&gt;dynamic-content#update" data-dynamic-content-show-param="#certificates-selected #certificates-content" data-dynamic-content-hide-param="#view-courses-selected #view-courses-content" href="#">Certificates</a><div class="c-button c-button--slim c-button--blue-300 u-flex-grow-1">Training</div></div></div><div id="certificates-selected"><div class="c-button-group u-align-center u-pt12"><div class="c-button c-button--slim c-button--blue-300 u-flex-grow-1">Certificates</div><a class="c-button c-button--slim c-button--blue-300 u-flex-grow-1 c-button--ghost" data-action="click-&gt;dynamic-content#update" data-dynamic-content-show-param="#view-courses-selected #view-courses-content" data-dynamic-content-hide-param="#certificates-selected #certificates-content" href="#">Training</a></div></div><div class="u-pt24"><a class="u-text-color-white u-arrow-link" href="/education">Learn more</a></div></div></div></div><div class="o-grid__cell o-grid__cell--width-70"><div class="glide glide--new-style" data-dynamic-content-options="fade-in" id="certificates-content"><div class="glide__track glide__track--margin" data-glide-el="track"><ul class="glide__slides u-pt24 u-pb24"><li class="glide__slide"><div class="c-card c-card--actionable"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--decoration"><div class="c-card__image"><img src="/assets/home/CCSK-card-edace19a9df7fff5273d4cb08400ce338a22d093a37fc0e58adcfa3454d4e064.png" /></div></div><div class="c-card__item u-pb16">The standard for cloud security expertise</div><a class="u-position-center" href="/education/ccsk"></a></div></li><li class="glide__slide"><div class="c-card c-card--actionable"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--decoration"><div class="c-card__image"><img src="/assets/home/CCZT-card-1fcc33d840cc82c01d2d7ea90fbac1513d334213745f794d017b220c4523d939.png" /></div></div><div class="c-card__item u-pb16">The first authoritative Zero Trust certificate</div><a class="u-position-center" href="/education/cczt"></a></div></li><li class="glide__slide"><div class="c-card c-card--actionable"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--decoration"><div class="c-card__image"><img src="/assets/home/TAISE-card-62294d9b07aad87b6709040b5fb7c72d2335082be4c95e4b75470bdf899d2675.png" /></div></div><div class="c-card__item u-pb16">The global standard for responsible AI</div><a class="u-position-center" href="/education/taise"></a></div></li></ul></div><div class="u-hidden--desktop"><div class="glide__arrows" data-glide-el="controls"><button class="glide__arrow glide__arrow--left glide__arrow--edge u-text-color-gray-500" data-glide-dir="&lt;"><i class="fas fa-chevron-left fa-2x"></i></button><button class="glide__arrow glide__arrow--right glide__arrow--edge u-text-color-gray-500" data-glide-dir="&gt;"><i class="fas fa-chevron-right fa-2x"></i></button></div></div></div><div class="glide glide--new-style" data-dynamic-content-options="fade-in" id="view-courses-content" style="display: none;"><div class="glide__track glide__track--margin" data-glide-el="track"><ul class="glide__slides u-pt24 u-pb24"><li class="glide__slide"><div class="c-card c-card--actionable"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--decoration"><div class="c-card__image"><img src="/assets/home/CSA-CIS-training-card-615f29df215d046af11ea85e984b2234960dc9bcf92ef7b500a613235c4f83fc.png" /></div></div><div class="c-card__item u-pb16">An introduction to key cloud security topics</div><a class="u-position-center" href="/education/cloud-infrastructure-security-training"></a></div></li><li class="glide__slide"><div class="c-card c-card--actionable"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--decoration"><div class="c-card__image"><img src="/assets/home/STAR-lead-auditor-card-cc29f38ee9f444bc8add2f81cc84be28754592f83c8faf561d50bdf81051cd47.png" /></div></div><div class="c-card__item u-pb16">Audit CSPs against the STAR certification</div><a class="u-position-center" href="/education/star-lead-auditor-training/"></a></div></li><li class="glide__slide"><div class="c-card c-card--actionable"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--decoration"><div class="c-card__image"><img src="/assets/home/ACSP-card-4ba2270c214d2718dd318859fc2bb8b8fb97941353db993368c90cb635849039.png" /></div></div><div class="c-card__item u-pb16">Practical cloud security and applied DevSecOps</div><a class="u-position-center" href="/education/advanced-cloud-security-practitioner-training"></a></div></li></ul></div><div class="u-hidden--desktop"><div class="glide__arrows" data-glide-el="controls"><button class="glide__arrow glide__arrow--left glide__arrow--edge u-text-color-gray-500" data-glide-dir="&lt;"><i class="fas fa-chevron-left fa-2x"></i></button><button class="glide__arrow glide__arrow--right glide__arrow--edge u-text-color-gray-500" data-glide-dir="&gt;"><i class="fas fa-chevron-right fa-2x"></i></button></div></div></div></div></div><div class="o-grid u-desktop-pt80 o-grid--small-full o-grid--medium-full" id="homepage-membership"><div class="o-grid__cell o-grid__cell--width-45"><div class="u-hidden--mobile"><img src="/assets/home/membership-illustration-8e99115c6a93a7a123c35c544093833d158fa6b0a8fe9c0a52555b46d2e54aaa.png" /></div></div><div class="o-grid__cell o-grid__cell--width-5"></div><div class="o-grid__cell o-grid__cell--width-50"><h2 class="c-heading c-heading--section-alt">Explore Membership with CSA</h2><h5>Become part of a global community dedicated to securing the cloud. Our memberships cater
to a diverse range of organizations.</h5><p class="u-text-color-gray-500">CSA membership benefits cater to the needs of every phase throughout
the cloud journey.</p><p class="u-text-color-gray-500">Whether your goal is to develop a secure cloud strategy, gain customer
trust, empower your workforce, enhance brand awareness, or engage in diverse networking
opportunities, CSA membership is the solution.</p><a class="u-arrow-link" href="/membership">Discover membership benefits</a></div></div><div class="u-hidden--desktop u-pt32"><img src="/assets/home/membership-illustration-8e99115c6a93a7a123c35c544093833d158fa6b0a8fe9c0a52555b46d2e54aaa.png" /></div></div></div></div><div class="o-area o-area--layered" style="overflow: visible;"><div class="o-area__layer u-bg-color-gray-800"></div><div class="o-area__layer" style="background: none;
background-size: contain;
background-repeat: no-repeat;
background-image: url(/assets/home/STAR-bg-left-816852817f7698f6df17bde142ecc18baf4416e593fbbe7b9109383c7962ddb5.png);
background-position: bottom left;"></div><div class="o-area__layer" style="background: none;
background-size: contain;
background-repeat: no-repeat;
background-image: url(/assets/home/STAR-bg-right-5b5db65198a6dbdc7185568b9e710ac43fa855b2670b7414ae60331330cb4569.png);
background-position: top right;"></div><div class="o-area__layer" style="background: none; position: relative; overflow: visible;"><div class="u-hidden--mobile"><img style="position: absolute; top: -40px; right: 0; z-index: 1; max-width: min(40vw, 620px);" src="/assets/home/STAR-hero-e6b0eada8ec994b1ea1e17de5fb91f49cbdab2e0558e26f9360aa7bd8de982b5.png" /></div></div><div class="o-area__top-layer u-text-color-white"><div class="o-container u-pt64 u-pb64" id="homepage-star"><div class="o-flex-grid o-flex-grid--row"><div class="o-flex-grid o-flex-grid--column"><h2 class="c-heading c-heading--section-alt">Building Customer Trust with STAR</h2><h5>Elevate your cloud security reputation by publishing to <a class="u-text-color-blue-300" href="/star/registry">CSA&#39;s STAR Registry</a> <strong>with 2,500+ entries.</strong></h5><p class="u-text-color-gray-75">Outlined from the <a class="u-text-color-blue-300" href="/research/cloud-controls-matrix">Cloud Controls Matrix (CCM)</a> , showcase your commitment to transparency, rigorous auditing, and compliance alignment
by streamlining customer trust and reducing administrative burdens.</p><p><a class="c-button c-button--orange c-button--ghost u-mt24" href="/star">Learn more</a></p></div><div class="o-flex-grid o-flex-grid--column"><div class="u-hidden--desktop"><img src="/assets/home/STAR-hero-e6b0eada8ec994b1ea1e17de5fb91f49cbdab2e0558e26f9360aa7bd8de982b5.png" /></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="o-area o-area--layered o-area--alternating"><div class="o-area__layer u-bg-color-gray-25"><div class="u-hidden--mobile" style="position: relative; width: 100%;"><img style="position: absolute; right: 46%; height: 564px;" src="/assets/home/Research-graphic-358e07c16d2f957262fc773d2b320ea5a6a5406ab7604926a704bd431a90646a.png" /></div></div><div class="o-area__top-layer"><style>.research-link {
  color: #00549F;
  &:hover {
    color: #0093FF;
  }
}</style><div class="o-container u-pt64 u-pb64" id="homepage-research"><div class="o-flex-grid o-flex-grid--row"><div class="o-flex-grid o-flex-grid--column"></div><div class="o-flex-grid o-flex-grid--column"><h2 class="c-heading c-heading--section-alt">Empowering Cybersecurity Through Research</h2><p>Discover CSA’s latest research at the forefront of cloud security. Dive into new insights,
contribute to peer reviews, and submit your innovative ideas to shape the future of cloud
security.</p><div class="o-grid o-grid--small-full o-grid--medium-full o-grid--large-fit"><div class="o-grid__cell"><div class="o-flex-grid o-flex-grid--column"><a class="research-link" href="/research/publications"><div class="o-flex-grid o-flex-grid--row u-flex-align-items-center u-flex-nowrap u-flex-nogap"><img width="84" src="/assets/home/view-latest-research-301c2670fdce46c019d292e038c527211b7d3ec2ed8acda928350b414fa6b715.svg" /><h5 class="u-mb0">View Latest Research</h5></div></a></div></div><div class="o-grid__cell"><div class="o-flex-grid o-flex-grid--column"><a class="research-link" href="/research/contribute"><div class="o-flex-grid o-flex-grid--row u-flex-align-items-center u-flex-nowrap u-flex-nogap"><img width="84" src="/assets/home/participate-in-peer-reviews-3c59593de21f863aaf7c61f5e0b2530db8eead968fe86513088ee73d4c04946b.svg" /><h5 class="u-mb0">Participate in Peer Reviews</h5></div></a></div></div></div><div class="o-grid o-grid--small-full o-grid--medium-full o-grid--large-fit"><div class="o-grid__cell"><div class="o-flex-grid o-flex-grid--column"><a class="research-link" href="/research/working-groups"><div class="o-flex-grid o-flex-grid--row u-flex-align-items-center u-flex-nowrap u-flex-nogap"><img width="84" src="/assets/home/explore-working-groups-7cce2d92c1d2149a2dc01c1655217426d5c4d12999573873e17f604df121acfb.svg" /><h5 class="u-mb0">Explore 40+ Working Groups</h5></div></a></div></div><div class="o-grid__cell"><div class="o-flex-grid o-flex-grid--column"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="u-hidden--desktop"><div style="background-image: url(/assets/home/Research-graphic-358e07c16d2f957262fc773d2b320ea5a6a5406ab7604926a704bd431a90646a.png);
background-size: cover;
background-position: center center;
height: 300px;"></div></div></div></div><div class="o-area o-area--alternating"></div><div class="o-area o-area--separated o-area--alternating"><div class="o-container u-pb20" id="homepage-initiatives"><h2 class="c-heading c-heading--section">Strategic Initiatives</h2><div class="o-grid o-grid--small-full o-grid--medium-full"><div class="o-grid__cell o-grid__cell--width-80 o-grid__cell--offset-10"><p class="u-align-center">At the forefront of cutting-edge best practices, CSA's initiatives each represent a commitment to
excellence, driving industry standards, and collaboration. Explore initiatives and their related
resources:</p></div></div><div class="glide glide--new-style" id="initiatives-carousel"><div class="glide__track glide__track--margin" data-glide-el="track"><ul class="glide__slides"><li class="glide__slide u-pt24 u-pb24"><div class="c-card c-card--exhibit c-card--actionable u-mb24"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--revealable c-card__item--decoration"><div class="c-card__revealed"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/home/AI-safety-initiative-homepage-1e99b1542cb78f9b48a842b0e04d51247fd5fd42b0f35d39640e7e95ee37ec3e.png" /></div><div class="c-card__consealed"><h3>AI Safety Initiative</h3><p class="u-pt16">Developing AI ethical use and risk mitigation to foster responsible AI adoption and innovation.</p><a class="u-position-center" href="/research/working-groups/artificial-intelligence"></a></div></div></div></li><li class="glide__slide u-pt24 u-pb24"><div class="c-card c-card--exhibit c-card--actionable u-mb24"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--revealable c-card__item--decoration"><div class="c-card__revealed"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/home/ZTAC-dc68ea6551ffc49e30c069165dda2537c62653a77b10cf4b231c37ef868c3117.png" /></div><div class="c-card__consealed"><h3>Zero Trust Advancement Center</h3><p class="u-pt16">Leading the development of tools and resources to guide zero trust implementation.</p><a class="u-position-center" href="/zt"></a></div></div></div></li><li class="glide__slide u-pt24 u-pb24"><div class="c-card c-card--exhibit c-card--actionable u-mb24"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--revealable c-card__item--decoration"><div class="c-card__revealed"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/home/CxO-Trust-Initiative-6b6d3c99dd87624fcedea2d677143df1cc80b957aa6e1318e66b9789a1434aa5.png" /></div><div class="c-card__consealed"><h3>CxO Trust</h3><p class="u-pt16">Empowering C-level executives with strategic insights to navigate the evolving landscape of cloud security.</p><a class="u-position-center" href="/cxo-trust"></a></div></div></div></li><li class="glide__slide u-pt24 u-pb24"><div class="c-card c-card--exhibit c-card--actionable u-mb24"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--revealable c-card__item--decoration"><div class="c-card__revealed"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/home/FinCloud-Summit-08c4e95fd32682fcb48ddf24d6c3af59c0038195a2060a4c9130bb1de3c258f7.png" /></div><div class="c-card__consealed"><h3>FinCloud Security</h3><p class="u-pt16">Advancing secure financial services in the cloud through targeted research, best practices, and standards.</p><a class="u-position-center" href="/fincloud-security"></a></div></div></div></li><li class="glide__slide u-pt24 u-pb24"><div class="c-card c-card--exhibit c-card--actionable u-mb24"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--revealable c-card__item--decoration"><div class="c-card__revealed"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/home/TAICC-6fe9e0df7302ddcbd51f0fa8f768ae07b9cc4d628a1abb7e0e5c1c2b2e527d41.png" /></div><div class="c-card__consealed"><h3>Trusted AI &amp; Cloud Consultant</h3><p class="u-pt16">Connecting organizations with expert consultants who deliver trusted cloud and AI security solutions based on CSA best practices.</p><a class="u-position-center" href="/trusted-ai-and-cloud-consultant"></a></div></div></div></li><li class="glide__slide u-pt24 u-pb24"><div class="c-card c-card--exhibit c-card--actionable u-mb24"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--revealable c-card__item--decoration"><div class="c-card__revealed"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/home/TCP-9d87e888f9c4c4da0dd59f8eea7d4bde378e901706de842bd377d00ce267e88a.png" /></div><div class="c-card__consealed"><h3>Trusted Cloud Provider</h3><p class="u-pt16">Setting the benchmark for secure and reliable cloud services through rigorous compliance standards.</p><a class="u-position-center" href="/trusted-cloud-provider"></a></div></div></div></li><li class="glide__slide u-pt24 u-pb24"><div class="c-card c-card--exhibit c-card--actionable u-mb24"><div class="c-card__item c-card__item--revealable c-card__item--decoration"><div class="c-card__revealed"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/home/Compliance-Automation-Revolution-879a0d1d0d4f3456d0281d5f75190ca4c161dc94794822ecde90823b32b201fe.png" /></div><div class="c-card__consealed"><h3>Compliance Automation Revolution</h3><p class="u-pt16">Driving compliance automation by reducing manual work, increasing efficiency, and aligning security with compliance.</p><a class="u-position-center" href="/car"></a></div></div></div></li></ul></div><div class="glide__arrows" data-glide-el="controls"><button class="glide__arrow glide__arrow--right glide__arrow--edge u-text-color-gray-500" data-glide-dir="&gt;"><i class="fas fa-chevron-right fa-2x"></i></button><button class="glide__arrow glide__arrow--left glide__arrow--edge u-text-color-gray-500" data-glide-dir="&lt;"><i class="fas fa-chevron-left fa-2x"></i></button></div></div></div></div><div class="o-area o-area--separated o-area--alternating"><div class="o-container u-pb32" data-controller="dynamic-content" id="homepage-events"><h2 class="c-heading c-heading--section">Latest Insights & Events</h2><div class="o-grid o-grid--small-full o-grid--medium-full"><div class="o-grid__cell o-grid__cell--width-25"><div class="c-button c-button--slim u-full-width u-align-center u-mb16 c-button--blue c-button--shadow upcoming-events-selected">Upcoming Events</div><div class="upcoming-events-selected" data-dynamic-content-options="expand-vertically"><p>Network and collaborate through CSA in-person conferences and virtual events.
Gain insights directly from industry experts.</p><p class="u-pb12"><a class="u-arrow-link" href="/events">View all events</a></p></div><a class="c-button c-button--slim u-full-width u-align-center u-mb16 c-button--gray upcoming-events-selected-hide" style="display: none;" data-action="click-&gt;dynamic-content#update" data-dynamic-content-show-param=".upcoming-events-selected .webinars-selected-hide .blogs-selected-hide" data-dynamic-content-hide-param=".webinars-selected .blogs-selected .upcoming-events-selected-hide" href="#">Upcoming Events</a><div class="c-button c-button--slim u-full-width u-align-center u-mb16 c-button--blue c-button--shadow webinars-selected" style="display: none;">Webinars</div><div class="webinars-selected" data-dynamic-content-options="expand-vertically" style="display: none;"><p>Earn CPE credits by viewing upcoming and on-demand webinars on new technologies
and trends.</p><p class="u-pb12"><a class="u-arrow-link" href="/events/webinars">View all webinars</a></p></div><a class="c-button c-button--slim u-full-width u-align-center u-mb16 c-button--gray webinars-selected-hide" data-action="click-&gt;dynamic-content#update" data-dynamic-content-show-param=".webinars-selected .blogs-selected-hide .upcoming-events-selected-hide" data-dynamic-content-hide-param=".upcoming-events-selected .blogs-selected .webinars-selected-hide" href="#">Webinars</a><div class="c-button c-button--slim u-full-width u-align-center u-mb16 c-button--blue c-button--shadow blogs-selected" style="display: none;">Blogs</div><div class="blogs-selected" data-dynamic-content-options="expand-vertically" style="display: none;"><p>Stay updated with our latest blog posts on cloud security insights, trends, and
